      "finding": "Native SELECT Escape was intercepted as page Back.",
      "resolution": "Shared controller edit cancels first; native editor Escape retains browser dismissal. Non-editor fresh Escape focuses Return without navigating.",
      "evidence": "Actual-host regression distinguishes ordinary SELECT, first controller-edit Escape, subsequent native SELECT Escape and SUMMARY page Back."
    },
    {
      "finding": "Numbered archive About requested nonexistent archive-local releases/index.json.",
      "resolution": "Only exact HTTPS mekhovov.github.io numbered archive immutable About routes use the canonical main releases catalogue. Return remains same edition and generic/custom/HTTP/lookalike routes retain prior scope.",
